This project implements the upstream account, API key, scheduling, gateway,
and administration interfaces in TypeScript using Supabase Auth, PostgreSQL,
and Edge Functions. frontend/ vendors the original Vue console at the pinned
revision with product branding, API integration, build, and deployment changes.
The frontend's required legal documents are retained in docs/legal/. The original Go backend is retained in backend/ for local management integration;
its original source comments and copyright notices are preserved. Supabase hosts
the cloud gateway and its supporting data and identity services.
Source and build/deployment instructions are included. This project is maintained
independently and is not an official Sub2API release.

Local modifications also replace default product branding, logo and visible
welcome copy, and use the existing compact home page. Supabase names the
deployment platform; this project is not an official Supabase product.
Code comments and the primary documentation are translated into English;
README.zh-CN.md provides the Chinese documentation. Upstream attribution is retained.

The provider model picker metadata is derived from the pinned upstream
OpenAI, Claude, and Gemini CLI catalogs in backend/internal/pkg/.

The model-rate seed is derived from the pinned upstream resource
backend/resources/model-pricing/model_prices_and_context_window.json.

The Public Suffix List seed in supabase/migrations/20261015030000_public_suffixes.sql
is derived from https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat at revision
3929462652695bad04f0a27afb600974014a3c8b. The seed converts domain names to ASCII
IDNA form and is distributed under Mozilla Public License 2.0; see
docs/legal/PUBLIC_SUFFIX_LICENSE.txt. Other project licensing remains unchanged.
